4. Privilege Escalation Through Procedure Execution
Query

Find procedures:

select name
from sysobjects
where type='P'
and (
      name like '%Admin%'
   or name like '%User%'
   or name like '%Role%'
)

Check:

sp_help <proc_name>

Try execution if safe:

exec <proc_name>
Finding

Excessive Stored Procedure Execution Permissions

Impact

May allow unauthorized access to privileged functionality.

